        "cooked": "<p>Less of a gameplay thing than just an example of the end of a great session.&nbsp; Attached photo is mid-Round 7 as Legacy is about to take Advanced Ambuscade down with a Motivational Charge.&nbsp; As you can see from the hero HP tokens this is a win by a razor-thin edge.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/9/996d7d6ea9171dcac724bab21e052a3f0a13557c.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/996d7d6ea9171dcac724bab21e052a3f0a13557c\" title=\"SotM Game - advAB.jpg\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/996d7d6ea9171dcac724bab21e052a3f0a13557c_2_666x500.jpeg\" alt=\"SotM Game - advAB.jpg\" data-base62-sha1=\"lThDjHoBzVkdDCXWyk1kcibRuSE\" width=\"666\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/996d7d6ea9171dcac724bab21e052a3f0a13557c_2_666x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/996d7d6ea9171dcac724bab21e052a3f0a13557c_2_999x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/996d7d6ea9171dcac724bab21e052a3f0a13557c_2_1332x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/996d7d6ea9171dcac724bab21e052a3f0a13557c_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">SotM Game - advAB.jpg</span><span class=\"informations\">1469×1102 324 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
