        "id": 84014,
        "name": "danmarshall14",
        "username": "danmarshall14",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/danmarshall14/{size}/1944_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-01-02T14:43:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Reminds me of a session I had&nbsp;against Voss.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Tachyon, Wraith, and Legacy are all incapped, with Bunker the only one remaining (at like 5 HP).&nbsp; I sat there, hunkered down in Recharge Mode and Armored Plating, picking away at Voss with the Gatling Gun while slowly charging the Omnicannon.&nbsp; After probably six turns of a stand-off, I finally came out swinging with Turret Mode; Gatling Gun, Flak Cannon, and an unleashed Omnicannon for just enough damage to take the win.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Those narrow escapes are the most satisfying by far.</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:07:16.145Z",
